    },
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "最終結果、もう出たんだろう？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ！\r\n咲耶、最終審査通過、おめでとう！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ふう……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nたくさんの人の前でパフォーマンスができるんだね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのとおりだ\r\n今までとは比較にならないくらい大勢の人に見てもらえるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "とうとう、ここまで辿り着いたんだね\r\nプロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。ずっと目指してきた、大きな舞台だ\r\n緊張するか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね\r\nまったくしていないと言えば、嘘になるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "むしろ、今までで１番、緊張しているかもしれない",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすがの咲耶でもそうなってしまうか",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも……同時に絶対大丈夫だと思えるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "数多くのレッスンをこなしてきた。体調も万全\r\nそして……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の傍には、プロデューサーがいる\r\nだから、安心して舞台に立てる",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶……\r\nそう言ってもらえると、プロデューサー冥利に尽きるよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、感動するのはまだ早いよ\r\nプロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ここまで来たんだ、\r\nきっと頂点に立ってみせるからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、咲耶なら、きっとできるよ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070130"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001070140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私と一緒に『W.I.N.G.』まで行こう！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600107/7006001070140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ！　がんばるぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（本番を通して、咲耶はきっともっと成長する）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（これからどんな風に咲耶が成長するのか、\r\n今から楽しみだな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]